instruction:
From these journal records, return a JSON array of the messages whose PRIORITY is 3 (error) or lower:
{"PRIORITY": "6", "MESSAGE": "started"}
{"PRIORITY": "3", "MESSAGE": "failed to bind port"}
{"PRIORITY": "4", "MESSAGE": "config reload"}
{"PRIORITY": "1", "MESSAGE": "kernel panic averted"}

output:
FACILITIES = ["kern", "user", "mail", "daemon", "auth", "syslog", "lpr", "news",
              "uucp", "cron", "authpriv", "ftp", "ntp", "audit", "alert", "clock"]
FACILITIES += ["local%d" % i for i in range(8)]
SEVERITIES = ["emerg", "alert", "crit", "err", "warning", "notice", "info", "debug"]

def decode_priority(pri):
    return {"priority": pri, "facility": FACILITIES[pri // 8],
            "severity": SEVERITIES[pri % 8]}
